<title>GREECE: STOCKS TRADING EX-DIV, EX-RIGHTS MONDAY.</title>
<headline>STOCKS TRADING EX-DIV, EX-RIGHTS MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of construction firm Aktor</p>
<p>and industrial baker Katselis are trading</p>
<p>ex-rights on Monday, the Athens stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Also on Monday, the following shares are trading</p>
<p>ex-dividend:</p>
<p>    COMPANY		   DIV/SHARE   ADJUSTED PRICE</p>
<p>    Nafpactos		    35	     745</p>
<p>    Papaellinas		 100	   1,490</p>
<p>    Elais			 407	   7,843</p>
<p>    European Technical	50	     631</p>
<p>    K.I.Sarandopoulos	120	   1,760</p>
<p>    Ergo Invest		  60	     705</p>
<p>    NEL			   70	     780</p>
<p>    Aktor			120	   2,507</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
